    "## **4. Train/Val/Test Split**\n",
    "\n",
    "Time-series split (chronological order):\n",
    "- Train: 80%\n",
    "- Val: 10%\n",
    "- Test: 10%"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "13901041",
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
