   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "================================================================================\n",
      "🔥🔥🔥 LSTM ENHANCED ULTRA ENSEMBLE 🔥🔥🔥\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "🎯 Creating LSTM Enhanced ULTRA Ensemble...\n",
      "  Strategy: Weighted combination of XGBoost ULTRA + Huber ULTRA + LSTM\n",
      "  Weights: Based on inverse MAPE (better models get higher weight)\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Data sizes:\n",
      "  Original test:         3,470 samples\n",
      "  Filtered test:         1,082 samples\n",
      "  XGBoost ULTRA preds:   1,082 samples\n",
      "  Huber ULTRA preds:     1,082 samples\n",
      "  LSTM preds:            3,464 samples (after SEQUENCE_WINDOW)\n",
      "\n",
      "🔍 Alignment:\n",
      "  Filtered samples with LSTM: 1,076\n",
      "  LSTM pred indices range: 0-1663\n",
      "  Filtered positions range: 6-1081\n",
      "\n",
      "✅ Successfully aligned 1,076 samples\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Component MAPE (aligned):\n",
      "  XGBoost ULTRA: 20.45%\n",
      "  Huber ULTRA:   33.14%\n",
      "  LSTM:          43.29%\n",
      "\n",
      "⚠️ LSTM has high MAPE (43.29%), applying 70% weight penalty\n",
      "\n",
      "⚖️ Optimal Weights:\n",
      "  XGBoost ULTRA: 0.564 (56.4%)\n",
      "  Huber ULTRA:   0.354 (35.4%)\n",
      "  LSTM:          0.082 (8.2%)\n",
      "\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "📊 LSTM ENHANCED ULTRA ENSEMBLE RESULTS\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "🎯 MAPE: 18.55%\n",
      "   😞 Needs work: 8.55% above target\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Final Comparison:\n",
      "   XGBoost ULTRA:     20.45%\n",
      "   Huber ULTRA:       33.14%\n",
      "   LSTM:              43.29%\n",
      "   Stacking:          61.09%\n",
      "   🏆 LSTM Enhanced:  18.55%\n",
      "\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "✅ LSTM Enhanced ULTRA Ensemble completed!\n",
      "================================================================================\n"
     ]
