     "text": [
      "================================================================================\n",
      "🎯 STRATEGY 3: SUPER ENSEMBLE - COMBINE ALL BEST MODELS\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Gathering all model predictions...\n",
      "  ✅ NUCLEAR XGBoost:      14.04%\n",
      "  ✅ Commodity-Aware:      13.45%\n",
      "  ✅ Polynomial Features:  16.58%\n",
      "  ⚠️ MEGA Ensemble:        Skipped (not trained yet)\n",
      "\n",
