    "- **Proteins (meat, fish):** Variable, seasonal → May get 20-30% MAPE\n",
    "- **Vegetables:** Highly seasonal → May get 30-50% MAPE\n",
    "\n",
    "**When we average these, we get ~13% MAPE.**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Final Strategy:**\n",
