      "================================================================================\n",
      "🔥 STRATEGY 3: CATBOOST (Often Beats XGBoost!)\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "💡 Why CatBoost:\n",
      "   • Often 1-3% better than XGBoost\n",
      "   • Better handling of categorical features\n",
      "   • Ordered boosting prevents overfitting\n",
      "   • Might push ensemble below 10%!\n",
