    "1. ✅ **Per-Commodity XGBoost** - Separate model for each commodity (10-20 models)\n",
    "2. ✅ **Extreme Feature Engineering** - Polynomial + lag + interactions (100+ features)\n",
    "3. ✅ **Optuna Hyperparameter Tuning** - Find PERFECT XGBoost params with 100 trials\n",
    "\n",
